                     drawline 
---------------------------------------------------------------
is a utility that allows to draw the gmsh geometry in jmol
Compile with gcc:

 $ gcc -o drawline drawline.c -lm

 
 The first step is to produce an unrolled geo file:
  
 $ gmsh -0 file.geo 

 This will produce file.geo_unrolled

 $ drawlines file.geo_unrolled 1e-9 >! scr.jmol

 Now the script can be used directly in jmol to draw the geometry

 $ jmol structure.xyz -s scr.jmol

                     gen2jmol
-------------------------------------------------------------
is a utility to convert upg to jmol xyz files adding supercell
vectors.
Example:

 $ gen2jmol tb.upg 2 2 2 

 this will set a jmol script 'scr.jmol' that can be loaded in jmol

